      "cooked": "<p>I love SotM and The Discworld and have been thinking about how to combine the two.</p><p>Would be great to see GtG get the Discworld licence and create a game using the SotM engine.</p><p>Like the Multiverse, the Discworld is oozing with interesting people and opportunities for great stories.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What do you think?</p>",
